# Playwright visual-regression baselines are environment-specific (Playwright
# names them per-OS, e.g. *-darwin.png). CI runs on Linux, so the correct
# shared baselines must be generated on the CI OS (Linux — via Docker
# `mcr.microsoft.com/playwright` or a CI --update-snapshots job) and committed
# THEN. Until VR is wired into CI, baselines stay local-only and are not
# committed (avoids bloating the repo with wrong-OS binaries).
# To generate locally:  pnpm --filter @fams/showcase test:visual:update
e2e/**/*-snapshots/

# Playwright run artifacts
test-results/
playwright-report/
